    "bottleneck": "Acknowledgement head-of-line blocking was the measured input bottleneck. Changed delivery accepts 8/8 centered inputs on both visits with 1,800ms response delay plus an injected lost acknowledgement; reordered 1,800ms processing is checked separately. Rendering retries now reload a valid battle lease instead of using destroyed GPU sources.",
    "limits": "Single-run/random-song loading values; baseline retry reached a ready button but failed to render, so its time is not successful time-to-play. No generalized loading/FPS speedup claim. Frame samples, long frames and API times are included per visit. Automated full-chart input adds headless probe overhead. The preliminary full-chart test preceded the final art-lifetime change; the final public-asset run covers a full chart on the released code. The first Windows processing-delay run hit a QA counter bug (counted old requests by completion time); lifecycle counters were all zero. The corrected test records request arrival, retains cancelled requests, and was rerun. WebKit precise AudioContext is unavailable in the existing environment.",
